[{:db/id "q-99313/selection/6370c5fcd71701036193328de51da8e98c9529d96a204b6e892116af5010cbf6" :answer/id #uuid "7fa8a653-056f-5cd0-a7ca-cb84abfe2e78" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =5∓2\\text{i}$ and $v=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ -2∓\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-99313/selection/45b2964ed0f6658519ef5e792321c8c8ed7042aa697715fc11ac142b1c695a04" :answer/id #uuid "8a403cc2-ec31-5d64-acda-5f35916aa08f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =1∓2\\text{i}$ and $v=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 5∓2\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-99313/selection/7d7591b5bc3a54396562382a0023b4f2452fcebfd092c46579800b769f1385e1" :answer/id #uuid "ba9e9a3d-a2bf-5a6e-b7e4-d2a1b0188b38" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =-2∓\\text{i}$ and $v=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 5∓2\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-99313/selection/98d1d9da0535938a16e25092ef9f33498f1d2756db9bc050fb60210f398ebfb2" :answer/id #uuid "0702507c-bb35-5a55-bcb0-f8398a9f7dbe" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =1∓2\\text{i}$ and $v=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 1∓2\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-99313/selection/4691180e226a8953014034c16f898777f3e37c11e1fc744a510699b6f2f9da07" :answer/id #uuid "77b76cb9-af70-54fa-a0d2-8f8d30962c30" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =-2∓\\text{i}$ and $v=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 2∓5\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-99313/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "d9004316-10a7-52ae-82fa-af5310d09883" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-99313/selection/7d7591b5bc3a54396562382a0023b4f2452fcebfd092c46579800b769f1385e1" :answer-field/choices ["q-99313/selection/6370c5fcd71701036193328de51da8e98c9529d96a204b6e892116af5010cbf6" "q-99313/selection/45b2964ed0f6658519ef5e792321c8c8ed7042aa697715fc11ac142b1c695a04" "q-99313/selection/7d7591b5bc3a54396562382a0023b4f2452fcebfd092c46579800b769f1385e1" "q-99313/selection/98d1d9da0535938a16e25092ef9f33498f1d2756db9bc050fb60210f398ebfb2" "q-99313/selection/4691180e226a8953014034c16f898777f3e37c11e1fc744a510699b6f2f9da07"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-99313" :question/id #uuid "fff68dac-09ab-5767-b8f2-36e8412fe6a8" :question/math-academy-id "q-99313" :question/problem "$$\nP=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 \\\\ 5 & -2\\end{aligned}],\\,C=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & -1 \\\\ 1 & -2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nConsider the matrix $P$ and the rotation-scaling matrix $C$ shown above. Given that $A=PC{P}^{-1},$ what are the eigenvalues and the corresponding eigenvectors of $A?$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that for any $2\\times 2$ real matrix $A$ with complex eigenvalues, we have $A=PC{P}^{-1},$ where \n\n$$\nP=[\\begin{aligned}| & | \\\\ \\text{Re}(v) & \\text{Im}(v) \\\\ | & |\\end{aligned}],\\,C=[\\begin{aligned}\\text{Re}(\\lambda ) & \\text{Im}(\\lambda ) \\\\ -\\text{Im}(\\lambda ) & \\text{Re}(\\lambda )\\end{aligned}],\n$$\n\nand $v$ is an eigenvector of $A$ corresponding to the complex eigenvalue  $\\lambda .$\n\n- From the matrix $C=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & -1 \\\\ -(-1) & -2\\end{aligned}],$ we deduce that $\\text{Re}(\\lambda )=-2$ and $\\text{Im}(\\lambda )=-1.$ So, our eigenvalue is\n\n$$\n\\lambda =-2+(-1)\\text{i}=-2-\\text{i}.\n$$\n\n- From the matrix $P=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 \\\\ 5 & -2\\end{aligned}],$ we deduce that our corresponding eigenvector is\n\n$$\nv=[\\begin{aligned}3+0\\text{i} \\\\ 5+(-2)\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 5-2\\text{i}\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nFinally, the second eigenvalue of $A$ must be the complex conjugate of $\\lambda ,$ and the second eigenvector must be the complex conjugate of $v.$\n\nTherefore, our eigenvalues and eigenvectors are \n\n$$\n\\lambda =-2∓\\text{i},\\,v=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 5∓2\\text{i}\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-99313/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1dcdd3f4-c03e-5887-a493-05598dbe4fc3"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-99313"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} [:db/retract 17592186129651 :question/answer-fields 17592186127700] {:db/id "q-39130/selection/ma-v1/8fb47d7893336ae8c925a2aa8be3f7bc4484fd7d54fe3a083b4e595844430ca7/78d1e69f384ef64ee6e1a4fbddfe852c4d46611aaa99f361c2e0edb4e1ad04c8" :answer/id #uuid "cd1e865e-060a-5c10-9c52-04cd1ab5196c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =5\\mp 2\\text{i}\\,$ and $\\,v=[\\begin{aligned}-1\\pm 4\\text{i} \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-39130/selection/ma-v1/8fb47d7893336ae8c925a2aa8be3f7bc4484fd7d54fe3a083b4e595844430ca7/00f3841dcdeb2066d89a82cf2165b541e720f2a9f5b370bf85bb31e090c661f3" :answer/id #uuid "601c5b4f-aa64-55c4-a6a5-6a26212694fd" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =-1\\pm 4\\text{i}\\,$ and $\\,v=[\\begin{aligned}5\\pm 2\\text{i} \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-39130/selection/ma-v1/8fb47d7893336ae8c925a2aa8be3f7bc4484fd7d54fe3a083b4e595844430ca7/4fcf082b11502ac65f107c99444b93a792cb5a6ff0d108e342b8140e13371494" :answer/id #uuid "d37da79c-7573-55d4-bcb2-695a45ffcaac" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =2\\pm 5\\text{i}\\,$ and $\\,v=[\\begin{aligned}-1\\pm 4\\text{i} \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-39130/selection/ma-v1/8fb47d7893336ae8c925a2aa8be3f7bc4484fd7d54fe3a083b4e595844430ca7/17d1c3d290c0744ecf5cd039f095508b60625e97ecde3b8662a93ba6d25a75e4" :answer/id #uuid "6ab4d36d-51eb-5ae9-b884-89cd6e95119b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =5∓2\\text{i}\\,$ and $\\,v=[\\begin{aligned}4\\pm \\text{i} \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-39130/selection/ma-v1/8fb47d7893336ae8c925a2aa8be3f7bc4484fd7d54fe3a083b4e5958